{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Puzzlers... prepare to meet your Doom.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/StackShootSurvive.gif?t=1741651454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blocks for Babies crosses roguelite block-stacking gameplay with first-person carnage. Form complete rows to clear lines in 2D, shoot to kill in 3D, and help Flapper clean up his blocks by any means necessary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/Features.gif?t=1741651454\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Stack falling tetrominos</strong> in classic arcade style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Shoot and destroy blocks</strong> in first-person\u2014fix mistakes, set up line clears, and fight the demonic horde</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless replayability</strong> with randomized boards and roguelite progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A mysterious story</strong>\u2014conquer devilish boss fights across distinct worlds to uncover the truth </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Art that's worthy of the fridge</strong>\u2014a satisfying mix of lush pixel art and retro 3D graphics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/GrowUpBigAndStrong.gif?t=1741651454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft a unique build with every roguelite run!</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Equip powerful abilities</strong> that trigger with each line clear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover a wide selection of upgrades</strong>, like passive perks, life-saving activatables, and satisfying weapon mods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Unlock new weapons</strong>, each with unique gunplay and game-changing effects on the 2D block-stacking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose what challenges you take on</strong> and what rewards you play for</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Keep getting stronger</strong> by purchasing persistent unlocks and rewards between runs </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/BabyBoomerShooter.gif?t=1741651454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adorable puzzle game. Brutal first-person shooter. With their powers combined, these disparate genres unlock a new dimension of gameplay satisfaction. We call that a baby boomer shooter... you'll call it your new favorite game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/Flapper_Wishlist-export.gif?t=1741651454\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2776770?t=1741651454","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741651454","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/c42a53b6e860766de0dd2eac703dda500c759d2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741651454","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/c42a53b6e860766de0dd2eac703dda500c759d2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741651454","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_sup